    "summary": "Five measures added to studyez_contracts/bank/quality.py as warnings only; errors and their wording are unchanged, so validate_dropping still drops nothing new and no bank is blocked. Lines are the p97 tail of the live Quiz Bank (35 lectures, 3,103 questions), kept in named constants. Live comparison: the 2026-11-07 Main-Quiz lecture (98 questions) gets 0 errors and 36 warnings with all five measures firing and the two questions the administrator quoted named by id; the 35 live banks get 62 new warnings, median 2 per bank, no yes/no-axis and no narrow-format hits. Two first-draft false positives found against live data and fixed with regression tests: single-letter O treated as polarity (34 hits such as Olaparib/O2/OCT1) and the unit-length line applied to basic. cloze frames are deliberately not measured. contracts and quizbank suites pass; full pytest tests is 2,098 passed with one failure, tests/runner/test_desktop_control.py shortcut installer, reproduced identically on a pristine origin/master worktree and left unfixed as unrelated. Server bank 33, route 171 unchanged, retention pass, map_numbers boundaries normal. No prompt, DB, server, web or operational data change; stored validation rows keep their old contents until something revalidates.",
